//// set: ax-e1 — 组件数组上推导式修饰按元素代入迭代变量（体是数组 / 含数组调用 / vector 字面量实参）：`s[1].r = r0 + f({…})`
//// model: E1
function f
  input Real t[3];
  output Real y[3];
algorithm
  y := 2 * t;
end f;
model S
  input Real r[3] = {0, 0, 0};
  input Real d[3] = {1, 0, 0};
end S;
model E1
  parameter Integer n = 2;
  Real lines[n, 2] = {{1, 2}, {3, 4}} * time;
  Real r0[3] = {1, 2, 3} * time;
  S s[n](d = {f({lines[i, 1], lines[i, 2], 0}) for i in 1:n}, r = {r0 + f(vector([lines[i, :]; 0])) for i in 1:n});
end E1;
//// model: E2
function f
  input Real t[3];
  output Real y[3];
algorithm
  y := 2 * t;
end f;
model S
  input Real r[3] = {0, 0, 0};
end S;
model E2
  Real r0[3] = {1, 2, 3} * time;
  S s[2](r = {f(r0) for i in 1:2});
  S s2[2](r = {r0 + f(r0) for i in 1:2});
  S s3[2](r = {r0 * i for i in 1:2});
end E2;
//// model: E3
function f
  input Real t[3];
  output Real y[3];
algorithm
  y := 2 * t;
end f;
model S
  input Real r[3] = {0, 0, 0};
end S;
model E3
  Real r0[3] = {1, 2, 3} * time;
  S s[2](r = {f(r0) for i in 1:2});
end E3;
//// model: E4
model S
  input Real r[3] = {0, 0, 0};
end S;
model E4
  Real r0[3] = {1, 2, 3} * time;
  S s3[2](r = {r0 * i for i in 1:2});
end E4;
